@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "诊疗助理" as A0
boundary "<u>:诊疗助理接口</u>" as B0
actor "诊所负责人" as A1
boundary "<u>:诊所负责人接口</u>" as B1
control "<u>:登记批次库存变</u>\n<u>动控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:批次存量</u>" as Stock
participant "<u>:盘点核实</u>" as Count
participant "<u>:库存变动</u>" as Movement
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-18办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-18办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Stock : 提出盘点核实(实点数和当前账面)
activate Stock
Stock -> Count : 保留实点快照(时点、原因、经办人)
activate Count
Count --> Stock : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Count
Stock --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Stock
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
A1 -> B1 : 确认盘点差异
activate B1
B1 -> B1 : 检查输入格式()
B1 -> K : 协调UC-18办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Stock : 确认盘点差异(负责人意见及快照)
activate Stock
Stock -> Count : 核对确认依据(当前流水与实点时点)
activate Count
Count --> Stock : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Count
Stock -> Movement : 形成盘点调整(批准差额、原盘点)
activate Movement
Movement --> Stock : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Movement
Stock --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Stock
end
K --> B1 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B1 --> A1 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B1
note over K,Movement
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
